>Does anyone know how to redirect the console of a VAXStation 2000
>(OPA0:) to one of the async ports?   We have a spare VS2000 without a
>monitor that we want to use as a simple pcsa server and would like to
>use it as a simple microvax.  The VS2000 is a one plane monochrome.
>
>I known that the VS3100 systems have a switch.   Is there something
>similar on the VS2000s, or do I have to remove the graphics board?
>
