If you take apart a VAXstation 2000, there's a switch inside that you
(whoops, a jumper) move to convert it to a MicroVAX 2000. It requires
serious disassembly of the box. After that, you can plug a DEC terminal
into serial port for the console.

You'll need a copy of a page from one of the manuals for th e machine.
I'm not sure where you can get one, however.

