I used to use a VS3100, 8 Meg, 24 Meg swap, RZ23, Ultrix 3.0, pretty
intensively as a big X-terminal, and it almost never even hesitated.

The DS3100s I've used, 16 Meg, 65 Meg swap, RZ55, Ultrix 3.0, build
