Subject: Binary data formats
Keywords: file formats, binary, integer, floating-point
Message-ID: <4021@hydra.gatech.EDU>
Date: 3 Dec 89 02:25:33 GMT
Followup-To: poster
Organization: Georgia Institute of Technology
