away any secrets):

BOOT (or empty file)	bs=512
SPACE (empty file)	bs=512
ROOT (or empty)		bs=10k
INSTCTRL (tar file -- see note below)  this and all the rest are bs=10k
SUBSET1
SUBSET2
 .
 .
 .

