On an 8-Meg VAXstation 3100 running Ultrix 3.0 I created a 10Meg file and
then did:

    # time dd if=in of=out bs=1024k

in the root mount point of each of the two internal rz23 disks and then
in the root mount point of the external rz55 disk.  The rz23 took about a
minute of real time.  The rz55 consistently took 10-15 seconds longer.
