From: alan@shodha.dec.com ( Alan's Home for Wayward Notes File.)
Newsgroups: comp.sys.dec
Subject: Re: choosing between ra70 and ra90 disks under Ultrix 3.x
Message-ID: <455@shodha.dec.com>
