	You forgot to include an HSC for Ultrix side of the picture.
	Having VMS and Ultrix on the same star coupler isn't a
	supported configuration.  See the V3.0 and V3.1 release
	notes for details.  The picture should look like:

      VAX 6310  DECsystem 5810
         |        /             
      HSC 50    HSCxx
         \      /
          \    /
           \  /
           TA78 tape drive

	I use this configuration and it works.  My Ultrix systems
	have their own HSC and star coupler.  We generally only
	have one port of the drive selected at a time depending
	on whether we want to access it from VMS or Ultrix.  You'll
	have to check with Field Service or the CSC to find out
	is this configuration is supported.  Offhand I don't know
	why it wouldn't be.

	If the recently announced KDM70 were supported on the
	DECsystem you wouldn't need the HSC.  I can't comment
	on whether a future version of Ultrix will support it.

