Subject: Re: DECstation 3100 Kernel size and Diskless Operation
Message-ID: <89Sep25.235807edt.30815@snow.white.toronto.edu>
Sender: <daemon>
Organization: Ziebmef home away from home
References: <1544@esunix.UUCP>
