	Yes, Ultrix supports the 2nd processor.  In the configuration
	file for the system is a parameter called "processors".  Set
	this to "2" and build a new kernel.  You can either run that
	kernel until the 2nd CPU comes or keep the vmunix around until
	then and then boot it.
