Xcfb2 is somewhat later than Xcfb; it did not see full field testing, and was
therefore not the default server.

It is somewhat later, which means some nasty bugs had been fixed.

But its important difference is that stipple fill is maybe 4X faster than
Xcfb, very important for ECAD applications.

