following request.

They have a VAX 750 under UNIX 4.2bsd. An FPA is available. Currently,
the system crashes about every 10 minutes with a "fatal error - illegal
operand". Investigations held on site came to suspect the FPA, which
had just been replaced. DIGITAL maintenance service has been unable to
address the problem, and proved to be incompetent in handling UNIX.

Two questions are asked:

1) What influence does the presence of an FPA have on the installation
of UNIX 4.2bsd?

