Subject: Do all third party TMs interpret tmcs==0 as 1600BPI?
Keywords: TM-11/TE-10, third party TM emulators, compatibility
Message-ID: <15391@shemp.CS.UCLA.EDU>
Date: 21 Aug 88 02:22:28 GMT
Sender: news@CS.UCLA.EDU
Reply-To: casey@CS.UCLA.EDU (Casey Leedom)
Organization: UCLA
