Subject: Re: DEC/Shell and SYS$SYLOGIN clash - help
Message-ID: <1266@nrcvax.UUCP>
Date: Mon, 2-Nov-87 17:30:56 EST
Article-I.D.: nrcvax.1266
Posted: Mon Nov  2 17:30:56 1987
